{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Make the step-body canary replay-visible**\n\nThe context remains in replay mode while processing the checkpointed `WAIT`, so the inherited `StepContext.logger` suppresses this INFO call. If validation regresses to execute the step body before rejecting the mismatch, requirement 11-1 will not observe that forbidden execution. Cast the logger to the concrete `Logger` and emit through `with_is_replaying(lambda: False)`, preserving its execution-scoped metadata.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7qE0Ky","finding_digest":"82bcda4537c37c562b6d8c5a2bdd00043e92577b9a4a2588bc5c37d289ef6fd6","finding_id":"arf_v1_qk6nurjxyn6fmk3nrrncxxiaaq","finding_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","identity_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","line":16,"observation_digest":"ebbf4c5496c3feeb2786b82959c4c1cd90f6fc0ccce9112b6bbd0040e5c183eb","observation_id":"aro_v1_5o7uyvewyp7owj4gxauvtrgbzw","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests/handlers/general/replay_operation_identity.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_qk6nurjxyn6fmk3nrrncxxiaaq","published_at":"2026-09-03T17:43:20Z","review_id":"arr_v1_33mwetldi2l5ndc742lk5ehtpt","reviewed_base_sha":"be1d349f153bf74d61e1104745b9ae77513f0697","reviewed_head_sha":"95a7a3386b152570435279789ae360f0a6486d52","reviewer":"codex","start_line":16,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":701},"record_id":"art_v1_7abaeiswkbie2do4aalvjzq2xb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T17:43:20Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
